OL,3,GNEWSABonnie Tyler's hometown pays
OL,4,Atribute with new mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural of Bonnie Tyler has been
OL,7,Funveiled in her hometown as a tribute
OL,8,Fto the global star "who never forgot
OL,9,Fher roots".
OL,11,FThe Holding Out For a Hero singer,
OL,12,Fwhose real name was Gaynor Hopkins,
OL,13,Fdied in a hospital in Portugal in July,
OL,14,Faged 75, after undergoing emergency
OL,15,Fintestinal surgery earlier this year.
OL,17,FHundreds lined the streets of Skewen,
OL,18,Fin Neath Port Talbot, where she was
OL,19,Fborn and raised, to pay their respects
OL,20,Fon the day of her funeral.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
