OL,3,GNEWSABonnie Tyler's hometown pays
OL,4,Atribute with new mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Steve Jenkins, who painted the
OL,7,Fpiece at Skewen Memorial Park, said it
OL,8,Fwas "important" and the "pressure was
OL,9,Fon" to get the artwork right for the
OL,10,Fcommunity.
